        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur SOLBOR, Crystal Bordeaux Knob with Soleil Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Crystal Bordeaux Knob with Soleil Rosette is a half-round knob that looks stunning. Grandeur Crystal Knobs are known for their clarity and beauty and the Clear Crystal Bordeaux Knob with Soleil Rosette exemplifies that. The Soleil Rose is available in a wide array of finishes. Choose from passage, privacy, and dummy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur SOLBOR Soleil Rosette with Bordeaux Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bordeaux Knob with Soleil Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: 24% Lead Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.25\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-SOLBOR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262393\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur SOLBOR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Crystal Bordeaux Knob with Soleil Rosette",
                "description": "The Crystal Bordeaux Knob with Soleil Rosette is a half-round knob that looks stunning. Grandeur Crystal Knobs are known for their clarity and beauty and the Clear Crystal Bordeaux Knob with Soleil Rosette exemplifies that. The Soleil Rose is available in a wide array of finishes. Choose from passage, privacy, and dummy functions.",
